  << /ActualText (The nSpire feed provides near\055real\055time network signals that can help Holafly move from reactive to proactive incident detection\056 The opportunity is to surface potential incidents through Slack and provide an incident\055focused dashboard where Carrier stakeholders can prioritize\054 investigate and track recovery before customer impact continues to grow\056)
